<title>USA: Boddie-Noell Properties Q3 $0.15 vs $0.16.</title>
<headline>Boddie-Noell Properties Q3 $0.15 vs $0.16.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C.</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dollars in thousands, except per share data</p>
<p>				Three months ended  Nine months ended</p>
<p>					   September 30,  September 30,</p>
<p>					     1996  1995     1996   1995</p>
<p> Net income				 463   467    1,278  1,381</p>
<p> Net income per share		  0.15  0.16     0.42   0.46</p>
<p> Net income				 463   467    1,278  1,381</p>
<p> Funds from Operations**	    1,171  1,078   3,295  3,228</p>
