<p>**  All Funds from Operations (&quot;FFO&quot;) amounts reflect the definition recommended by the National Association of Real Estate Investment Trusts, as modified in 1995 to eliminate amortization of deferred financing costs added back to net income when computing FFO.  FFO was previously reported as $1,107,000 and $3,346,000 for the quarter and nine months ended September 30, 1995, respectively.</p>
